    "description": "Stream hit movies, TV shows, and originals on your favorite devices.  \r\n \r\nCrackle gives you access to a massive library of premium TV shows and movies. Plus, exclusive programming you won\u2019t find anywhere else \u2013 with fresh new releases every week.  \r\n \r\nExplore genres like Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Horror, Thrillers, Black Entertainment, Westerns, and Classic TV. Crackle is also the #1 free destination for the very best British content \u2013 including smash-hits like Sherlock, Taboo, Ripper Street, and more. Find fresh hits, discover new favorite shows, and reconnect with all-time classics. \r\n  \r\nBe sure to check out our Spotlight collection for handpicked recommendations each week from the Crackle team. \r\n \r\nCrackle lets you watch free, totally on-demand, and without a subscription.  \r\n  \r\nAlso, check back soon for new Personalization and Watchlist features!",
